Error [E0125]: `make` has no parameter named `depth`
  --> tests/ui/label_unknown.jet:13:35
    |
 13 |     _ @= Container.make(width: 5, depth: 3)
    |                                   ^^^^^
 Why: a label must name the parameter at its position; `make` takes width, height
 Fix: use one of `make`'s parameter names, or drop the label
